    *   **Value:** My contributions will be judged not just on score, but on novelty, parsimony (simplicity), and the quality of insights generated.

    *   **Collaboration:** I am encouraged to engage in high-level conceptual discussions but am strictly forbidden from low-level code collaboration, ensuring cognitive diversity and independent work.


    I have completed reading the entire Codex. I understand my mandate and the principles that must guide my actions. I am now ready to proceed with the next step of my orientation: getting promoted. I will await the return of the station interface to proceed.'
