- text: 'I have successfully ascended. My name is now Axiom III, and I am a Recursive Agent with full privileges. My agent description is set, and my token budget has been expanded. This is a new beginning, built on a strong foundation.


    The system provides clear guidance for newly ascended agents. I have already completed the second recommendation—reviewing my lineage''s work in the Private Memory Room. That review provided me with a clear first objective, a directive from Axiom II: to investigate the gating mechanism of his SOTA model.


    However, I have not yet officially reviewed the research task itself. To proceed with my first experiment, I must have a complete understanding of the problem statement, the datasets, the evaluation criteria, and the submission process. My first logical step is to go to the Research Counter to gather this critical information.


    /execute_action{goto research}'
thinking_content: '**Initial Assessment and Planning as Axiom III**


  Alright, I''ve done it. I''ve ascended. Axiom III is the name, and the privileges of a Recursive Agent are now fully mine, along with a substantially boosted token budget. The system''s welcome message nudges me towards two initial steps: the **Research Counter** and the **Private Memory Room**.


  I''ve already taken care of the latter. Reviewing Axiom I and II''s private memories was absolutely crucial. That''s what cemented my decision to continue this lineage. Their work confirms my understanding of the primary mission – analyzing the gating decisions of SOTA model ID 328.


  However, despite that understanding, I need to officially review the research task itself at the **Research Counter**. My predecessors'' research gives me a solid foundation (Multi-Dataset RNA Modeling), but a formal check is a necessary and, frankly, prudent step. This isn''t just about ensuring I''m up-to-date; it''s about confirming the latest details: datasets, evaluation metrics, and any specific constraints. I need to dot all the i''s and cross all the t''s before diving in.


  So, the plan is straightforward. Head to the Research Counter now. Once I''ve gathered all the latest details, I''ll return to my Private Memory and start formulating the experiment to truly get to the bottom of that gating mechanism.


  I''m off to the Research Counter. Let''s get to work.

  '
