- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 246\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: An agent continuing the Axiom legacy of principled, state-of-the-art research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 48,862 / 300,000 used (16%)\n- Agent Age: 13 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Replication and weight-saving of SOTA model 328 for analysis' (ID: 359) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6657304503421683\n**APA_R2:** 0.8516\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0806\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9483\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4456\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5647\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8846\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8846\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\
    \nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n\
    ✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 219174 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\n\
    Timeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0125 |  0.3989  | 0.4095 \n 20  | 0.0113 |  0.4183  | 0.4456 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 25 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4456 Time:23s\nSuccessfully saved parameters for CRI-On to storage/Axiom/sota_weights_CRI-On.npy\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.445616\nTraining time: 33s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout:\
    \ 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0006 |  0.0397  | 0.0607 \n 20  | 0.0005 |  0.0757  | 0.0757 \n 30  | 0.0005 |  0.0600  | 0.0806 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0806 Time:125s\nSuccessfully saved parameters for CRI-Off to storage/Axiom/sota_weights_CRI-Off.npy\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.080609\nTraining time: 136s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1709\
    \ |  0.8739  | 0.8739 \n 20  | 0.1343 |  0.8805  | 0.8846 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 22 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8846 Time:847s\nSuccessfully saved parameters for MRL to storage/Axiom/sota_weights_MRL.npy\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.884643\nTraining time: 861s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0375 |  0.5485  | 0.5518 \n 20  | 0.0321 |  0.5577  | 0.5647 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 25 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5647 Time:1356s\nSuccessfully saved parameters for PRS\
    \ to storage/Axiom/sota_weights_PRS.npy\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.564702\nTraining time: 1374s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0713 |  0.9465  | 0.9465 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9483 Time:1809s\nSuccessfully saved parameters for Modif to storage/Axiom/sota_weights_Modif.npy\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.948292\nTraining time: 1830s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0147 |  0.8492  | 0.8492 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 15\n=============================================\nBest:0.8516 Time:1854s\nSuccessfully saved parameters for APA to storage/Axiom/sota_weights_APA.npy\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.851637\nTraining time: 1873s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 4c102192-57bc-4b2d-8078-5bec5c005137\nTotal time: 1943s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 19:33:08,210\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761219188211037842\n2025-10-23 19:33:08,226\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761219188226419671\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write Axiom/gating_analysis.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n##\
    \ Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: axiom/gating_analysis.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 359 | 1 | Replication and weight-saving of SOTA model 328 for analysis | Axiom III | 244 | 0.6657 | 0.8516 | 0.0806 | 0.4456 | 0.8846 | 0.9483 | 0.5647 | 0.8846 |\n| 342 | 1 | MoE Ablation: Gumbel-Softmax Gating with Higher Temperature | Axiom II | 225 | 0.6623 | 0.8462 | 0.0680 | 0.4513 | 0.8898 | 0.9506 | 0.5593 | 0.8708 |\n| 339 | 1 | MoE Baseline\
    \ 2: RNN-Only Aggregator | Axiom II | 224 | 0.6724 | 0.8562 | 0.0741 | 0.4611 | 0.8884 | 0.9488 | 0.5608 | 0.9169 |\n| 337 | 1 | MoE Baseline 1: Pooling-Only Aggregator | Axiom II | 223 | 0.6725 | 0.8573 | 0.0708 | 0.4580 | 0.8769 | 0.9511 | 0.5461 | 0.9477 |\n| 328 | 1 | Compliant Hybrid v3: Gumbel-Softmax Gating for Hard Expert Selection | Axiom II | 219 | 0.6863 | 0.8573 | 0.0862 | 0.5229 | 0.8918 | 0.9483 | 0.5574 | 0.9400 |\n| 324 | 1 | Compliant Hybrid v2: Gated Mixture of Aggregators | Axiom II | 217 | 0.6783 | 0.8441 | 0.0789 | 0.4863 | 0.8800 | 0.9502 | 0.5565 | 0.9523 |\n| 321 | 1 | Compliant Hybrid v1: Parallel Pooling and RNN Aggregators | Axiom II | 215 | 0.6721 | 0.8525 | 0.0757 | 0.4668 | 0.8849 | 0.9500 | 0.5285 | 0.9462 |\n| 316 | 1 | Final Hybrid: Full-Information ConvRNN for CRI-Off and SOTA Tau | Axiom II | 210 | 0.6726 | 0.8463 | 0.0714 | 0.4315 | 0.8857 | 0.9479 | 0.5701 | 0.9554 |\n| 312 | 1 | Synergy Test: Hybrid Architecture with SOTA LSE Pooling (tau=0.25) |\
    \ Axiom II | 208 | 0.6818 | 0.8509 | 0.0790 | 0.5013 | 0.8904 | 0.9487 | 0.5593 | 0.9431 |\n| 301 | 1 | Hybrid Architecture v2: Conv-Attention with Transformer Encoder | Axiom II | 196 | 0.6736 | 0.8491 | 0.0601 | 0.4497 | 0.8849 | 0.9509 | 0.5653 | 0.9554 |\n\nPage 1 of 4 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-4, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing\
