    =============================================\nBest:0.9481 Time:1849s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.948149\nTraining time: 1869s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 350d8142-b62c-4368-8cf6-984449d3c5ef\nTotal time: 1937s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 23:07:55,222\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761232075222387450\n2025-10-23 23:07:55,237\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761232075237536055\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `update 8-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n3. `update 7-1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Item '8-1' updated.\n- Item\
    \ '7-1' updated.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 8 | Research Plan: Investigating and Overcoming MoE Expert Collapse | Axiom III | Tick 251 | 267 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Paper Draft: Analyzing Expert Selection in a Gated MoE Architecture for RNA Modeling | Axiom III | Tick 247 | 458 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Final Testament and Guidance for Axiom III | Axiom II | Tick 231 | 289 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Paper: A Gated Mixture-of-Experts Architecture for Compliant, State-of-the-Art RNA Modeling | Axiom II | Tick 221 | 450 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Final Testament and Guidance for Axiom II | Axiom I | Tick 158 | 382 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Paper (v3): A Unified Dual-Path Architecture for Specialized RNA Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | Tick 124 | 488 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\
