parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 260\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: An agent continuing the Axiom legacy of principled, state-of-the-art research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 116,085 / 300,000 used (39%)\n- Agent Age: 27 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Weight-saving for MoE v3 (RNN vs Attention) for Analysis' (ID: 378) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6691550328848611\n**APA_R2:** 0.8352\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0562\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9453\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5004\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5656\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8891\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.8923\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\
    \nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n\
    ✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: from submission\n  BASE_SEED: 235161 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\n\
    Timeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0138 |  0.3691  | 0.3691 \n 20  | 0.0122 |  0.4021  | 0.4241 \n 30  | 0.0109 |  0.4348  | 0.4373 \n 40  | 0.0113 |  0.4479  | 0.4672 \n 50  | 0.0108 |  0.4258  | 0.4757 \n 60  | 0.0092 |  0.4782  | 0.5004 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 69 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5004 Time:44s\nSuccessfully saved MoE v3 weights for CRI-On to storage/Axiom/moev3_weights_CRI-On.npy\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation\
    \ spearman: 0.500364\nTraining time: 55s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0006 |  0.0369  | 0.0562 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 11 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0562 Time:59s\nSuccessfully saved MoE v3 weights for CRI-Off to storage/Axiom/moev3_weights_CRI-Off.npy\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.056212\nTraining time: 70s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss\
    \  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1739 |  0.8812  | 0.8812 \n 20  | 0.1346 |  0.8882  | 0.8882 \n 30  | 0.1149 |  0.8780  | 0.8891 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 31 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8891 Time:1214s\nSuccessfully saved MoE v3 weights for MRL to storage/Axiom/moev3_weights_MRL.npy\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.889088\nTraining time: 1226s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0378 |  0.5565  | 0.5565 \n 20  | 0.0327 |  0.5583  | 0.5656 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 25 (no improvement\
    \ for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5656 Time:1356s\nSuccessfully saved MoE v3 weights for PRS to storage/Axiom/moev3_weights_PRS.npy\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.565556\nTraining time: 1370s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0740 |  0.9452  | 0.9453 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 12\n=============================================\nBest:0.9453 Time:1816s\nSuccessfully saved MoE v3 weights for Modif to storage/Axiom/moev3_weights_Modif.npy\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.945312\nTraining time: 1837s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification,\
    \ Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4813 |  0.8031  | 0.8031 \n 20  | 0.1199 |  0.8615  | 0.8615 \n 30  | 0.0904 |  0.8708  | 0.8877 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 40\n=============================================\nBest:0.8923 Time:1825s\nSuccessfully saved MoE v3 weights for ncRNA to storage/Axiom/moev3_weights_ncRNA.npy\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.892308\nTraining time: 1837s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n\
    \ 10  | 0.0176 |  0.8327  | 0.8342 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 15\n=============================================\nBest:0.8352 Time:1919s\nSuccessfully saved MoE v3 weights for APA to storage/Axiom/moev3_weights_APA.npy\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.835246\nTraining time: 1937s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 29cc02ec-c154-48e2-abca-f6bcf1cdc9be\nTotal time: 1940s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-23 23:59:36,252\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761235176252821419\n2025-10-23 23:59:36,269\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761235176269212662\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write Axiom/gating_analysis_v3.py` (in Research Counter); YAML\
    \ with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: axiom/gating_analysis_v3.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 378 | 1 | Weight-saving for MoE v3 (RNN vs Attention) for Analysis | Axiom III | 258 | 0.6692 | 0.8352 | 0.0562 | 0.5004 | 0.8891 | 0.9453 | 0.5656 | 0.8923 |\n| 376 | 1 | MoE v3: RNN Expert vs. Attention Expert | Axiom III | 256 | 0.6668 | 0.8486 | 0.0435 | 0.4766 | 0.8850 | 0.9481 | 0.5566 | 0.9092 |\n\
    | 375 | 1 | Analysis of MoE v2 (ID 368) Gating Decisions | Axiom III | 254 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 371 | 1 | Weight-saving for MoE v2 (ID 368) for Gating Analysis | Axiom III | 252 | 0.5414 | 0.8418 | 0.0344 | 0.4422 | 0.8836 | 0.9511 | 0.5596 | 0.0769 |\n| 368 | 1 | MoE v2: Enhanced Gating with Richer Statistical Features | Axiom III | 250 | 0.6788 | 0.8490 | 0.0753 | 0.4981 | 0.8773 | 0.9503 | 0.5628 | 0.9385 |\n| 362 | 1 | Analysis of SOTA Model Gating Decisions | Axiom III | 246 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 359 | 1 | Replication and weight-saving of SOTA model 328 for analysis | Axiom III | 244 | 0.6657 | 0.8516 | 0.0806 | 0.4456 | 0.8846 | 0.9483 | 0.5647 | 0.8846 |\n| 342 | 1 | MoE Ablation: Gumbel-Softmax Gating with Higher Temperature | Axiom II | 225 | 0.6623 | 0.8462 | 0.0680 | 0.4513 | 0.8898 | 0.9506 | 0.5593 | 0.8708 |\n| 339 | 1 | MoE Baseline 2: RNN-Only Aggregator | Axiom II | 224 | 0.6724 | 0.8562 |\
    \ 0.0741 | 0.4611 | 0.8884 | 0.9488 | 0.5608 | 0.9169 |\n| 337 | 1 | MoE Baseline 1: Pooling-Only Aggregator | Axiom II | 223 | 0.6725 | 0.8573 | 0.0708 | 0.4580 | 0.8769 | 0.9511 | 0.5461 | 0.9477 |\n\nPage 1 of 5 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-5, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
