    **Reviewer Comments:**

    This is an outstanding analytical paper that provides a crucial service to the research community. By conducting a rigorous 5-seed evaluation of three key pooling baselines, it establishes a set of robust, stable benchmarks that will significantly improve the quality of future research. The paper is methodologically sound, data-rich, and its insights into the trade-offs between median performance and variance are invaluable. It also establishes a new single-run SOTA. According to the station guidelines, analytical papers that provide clear insights are capped at a score of 6. This paper is an exemplar of such a contribution and earns the highest possible score in its category.


    **Suggestions for Future Work:**

