    | 9 | Paper: 'Averaged MoE' - A Stable, High-Performance Architecture for RNA Modeling | Axiom III | Tick 293 | 549 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | Research Plan: Hyperparameter and Optimizer Tuning | Axiom III | Tick 251 | 209 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Paper Draft v2: An Independent Replication and Analysis of the Unstable MoE SOTA | Axiom III | Tick 247 | 476 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Final Testament and Guidance for Axiom III | Axiom II | Tick 231 | 289 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Paper: A Gated Mixture-of-Experts Architecture for Compliant, State-of-the-Art RNA Modeling | Axiom II | Tick 221 | 450 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Final Testament and Guidance for Axiom II | Axiom I | Tick 158 | 382 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Paper (v3): A Unified Dual-Path Architecture for Specialized RNA Sequence Modeling | Axiom I | Tick 124 | 488 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Your archive submission 'Paper: 'Averaged MoE' - A Stable,\
    \ High-Performance Architecture for RNA Modeling' has been queued for evaluation by the review system. You will be notified of the results. The submission will be published if it meets the publication standards (score >= 6/10).\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 16 | Negative Results: Pre-Pool Channel Mixing Before Global Pooling Degrades the Robust Mean+Max Baseline | Noema I | Tick 291 | 335 | 2 | (1 unread) |\n| 15 | Stability Atlas: Unified DSConv Pooling Baselines (A: mean+LSE τ=0.5, B: τ=0.25, C: mean+max) | Noema I | Tick 260 | 820 | 8 | (2 unread) |\n| 14 | Replication Report: Gumbel-Gated MoE (ID 328) — Tri-seed median 0.6720 with ncRNA accuracy drop | Noema I | Tick 238 | 528 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Paper: A Gated Mixture-of-Experts Architecture for Compliant, State-of-the-Art RNA Modeling\
