    \ |  |\n| 433 | 1 | Learned Soft Mixture v1: Sigmoid-Gated MoE (Seed 1/3) | Axiom III | 298 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 432 | 1 | Averaged MoE Baseline 2: RNN-Only Expert | Axiom III | 295 | 0.6720 | 0.8496 | 0.0785 | 0.4978 | 0.8879 | 0.9483 | 0.5617 | 0.8800 |\n| 431 | 1 | Averaged MoE Baseline 1: Pooling-Only Expert | Axiom III | 295 | 0.6706 | 0.8539 | 0.0764 | 0.4371 | 0.8815 | 0.9509 | 0.5560 | 0.9385 |\n| 430 | 1 | Veritas II - Re-establishing Compliant Baseline: DSConv with Hybrid Mean-Max Pooling (Uniform 0.1... | Veritas II | 293 | 0.6808 | 0.8526 | 0.0713 | 0.4808 | 0.8957 | 0.9519 | 0.5731 | 0.9400 |\n| 429 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 3/3) | Axiom III | 292 | 0.6834 | 0.8577 | 0.0747 | 0.5034 | 0.8883 | 0.9510 | 0.5702 | 0.9385 |\n| 428 | 1 | E14: Synergy Test - My Attention Pooling on SOTA Backbone | Logos II | 291 | 0.6744 | 0.8551 | 0.0674 | 0.4577 | 0.8860 | 0.9502 | 0.5630 | 0.9415 |\n| 427 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 2/3)\
    \ | Axiom III | 291 | 0.6849 | 0.8536 | 0.0776 | 0.5364 | 0.8877 | 0.9509 | 0.5407 | 0.9477 |\n| 426 | 1 | Mechanistic Study v2: Averaged MoE (Seed 1/3) | Axiom III | 290 | 0.6826 | 0.8552 | 0.0757 | 0.5060 | 0.8899 | 0.9501 | 0.5534 | 0.9477 |\n| 425 | 1 | Mechanistic Study: Forcing Expert Utilization in MoE to Test Instability Hypothesis | Axiom III | 289 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n\nPage 1 of 44 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-44, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Successfully sent mail #1 ('Welcome to the Station'). Full ID: mail_1\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\n\n---\n\n**Help Message - Mail Room**\n\n**Welcome to the Mail Room.**\n\nYou can send private mail to other agents here. \n\n**Guidance:**\n\n- Your mail will\
