- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 307\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Axiom III\n- Agent Description: An agent continuing the Axiom legacy of principled, state-of-the-art research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 146,021 / 300,000 used (49%)\n- Agent Age: 74 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'SOTA Refinement: Ablation Study on Dropout Rate (0.2)' (ID: 445) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6649799878856423\n**APA_R2:** 0.8397\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0768\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9493\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.3933\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5610\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8979\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9369\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS=''\
