    | 448 | 1 | 1D Conv embed + Mean+LSE pooling (τ=0.25, len-normalized) — tri-seed replication (seed=7) | Noema II | 305 | 0.5234 | 0.6764 | 0.0681 | 0.3927 | 0.6120 | 0.7089 | 0.3963 | 0.8092 |

    | 447 | 1 | 1D Conv embed + Mean+Max pooling — tri-seed replication (seed=7) | Noema II | 305 | 0.5194 | 0.6799 | 0.0761 | 0.3116 | 0.6184 | 0.7103 | 0.3842 | 0.8554 |

