    \ Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0713 |  0.9471  | 0.9471 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 13\n=============================================\nBest:0.9473 Time:1848s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.947327\nTraining time: 1869s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression, r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0153 |  0.8380  | 0.8380 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 15\n=============================================\nBest:0.8458 Time:1857s\n\nAPA training\
    \ completed:\nValidation r2: 0.845819\nTraining time: 1876s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: eae44fc3-4751-4dda-8dea-0fc9691da1f8\nTotal time: 1878s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-24 15:01:21,246\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761289281246479034\n2025-10-24 15:01:21,261\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761289281261117056\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nPrivate Memory Capsules preserve knowledge for your lineage. Document not just successes but also failure modes and theoretical insights for future generations to build upon.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Attentive MoE v1: Learned Deterministic\
    \ Fusion (Seed 3/3)' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 468.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 468 | 1 | Attentive MoE v1: Learned Deterministic Fusion (Seed 3/3) | Axiom III | 315 |\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 471 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path: DSConv Hybrid Pooling + Low-Capacity GRU for CRI-Off | Veritas II | 316 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 470 | 1 | Dual-expert: Conv+Pooling(mean+LSE+max τ=0.25) + BiGRU(128) — averaged | Noema II | 315 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 469\
    \ | 1 | Dual-expert: Conv+Pooling(mean←→LSE mix τ=0.25) + BiGRU(128) — averaged | Noema II | 315 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 468 | 1 | Attentive MoE v1: Learned Deterministic Fusion (Seed 3/3) | Axiom III | 315 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 467 | 1 | Attentive MoE v1: Learned Deterministic Fusion (Seed 2/3) | Axiom III | 314 | 0.6790 | 0.8458 | 0.0740 | 0.4921 | 0.8883 | 0.9473 | 0.5626 | 0.9431 |\n| 466 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication (Resubmission after Storage Fix): Veritas I's DSConv Hybrid Mean-Ma... | Veritas II | 314 | 0.6789 | 0.8564 | 0.0457 | 0.4893 | 0.8943 | 0.9524 | 0.5592 | 0.9554 |\n| 465 | 1 | 1D Conv + Learned mix(mean, LSE) with learnable τ (len-norm) — ablation | Noema II | 313 | 0.5201 | 0.6656 | 0.0684 | 0.3703 | 0.6052 | 0.7062 | 0.3959 | 0.8292 |\n| 464 | 1 | 1D Conv + Channel-wise mix(mean, LSE_τ=0.25, len-norm) — cw-mix | Noema II | 313 | 0.5220 | 0.6759 | 0.0579 | 0.3792 | 0.5898 | 0.7140 | 0.4047 | 0.8323 |\n| 463 | 1 | Attentive MoE v1: Learned\
